<div id=3D"outline-container-4" class=3D"outline-2">
<h2 id=3D"4">OSEC-2026-18: Marshal integer overflow leads to out-of-heap re=
ad</h2>
<div class=3D"outline-text-2" id=3D"text-4">
</div>
<div id=3D"outline-container-orgd7cb61d" class=3D"outline-3">
<h3 id=3D"orgd7cb61d">Hannes Mehnert announced</h3>
<div class=3D"outline-text-3" id=3D"text-orgd7cb61d">
<p>
Dear everyone,
</p>

<p>
a new advisory was published for the OCaml runtime. Below is the=20
advisory, you can as well find it at=20
<a href=3D"https://github.com/ocaml/security-advisories">https://github.com=
/ocaml/security-advisories</a> and=20
<a href=3D"https://osv.dev/list?q=3D&amp;ecosystem=3Dopam">https://osv.dev/=
list?q=3D&amp;ecosystem=3Dopam</a>
</p>

<p>
Best,
</p>

<p>
Hannes
</p>

<pre class=3D"example" id=3D"orge03d4d5">
