<h4 id=3D"org45fd83f">Exploit path</h4>
<div class=3D"outline-text-4" id=3D"text-org45fd83f">
<ol class=3D"org-ol">
<li>Craft 32-byte header: <code>Intext_magic_number_big</code> + 4 padding =
bytes +=20
<code>data_len =3D 2^64 - 16</code> + <code>num_objects =3D 0</code> + <cod=
e>whsize =3D 0</code>.</li>
<li>Append a valid object code byte stream (e.g., a "small string" code=20
<code>0x3F</code> =3D 31 bytes, or <code>CODE_STRING32</code> with an arbit=
