<li>Call <code>Marshal.from_bytes buf 0</code> (or <code>Marshal.from_strin=
g</code>).</li>
<li><code>data_size_unsafe</code> returns 0; OCaml-side check passes.</li>
<li>C-side check <code>0 + 32 + (2^64-16) =3D 16 &gt; len</code> passes (wr=
